    "title": "Road closures for 2026 Gulf Coast Salute Air Show - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WJHG Newsroom ,\n8 hours ago PANAMA CITY BEACH, Fla. (WJHG/WECP) - The following roads will be closed due to the 2026 Gulf Coast Salute Air Show this weekend at Russell-Fields City Pier. April 9-13th: L.C. Hilton Jr. Drive (west parking lot) will be closed from the roundabout to West Park Drive, from 5 am Thursday, April 9th through 5pm Monday, April 13th. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
